1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,647
The Eyeless: blind, enormous, and listening for you.

2
00:00:02,867 --> 00:00:04,147
Here's how it plays.

3
00:00:04,967 --> 00:00:09,138
Put the Noise marker on the zero space of the Time track, and the four Noise cards

4
00:00:09,138 --> 00:00:10,257
beside your play area.

5
00:00:11,067 --> 00:00:15,089
Your Noise level goes up by one for every Action card you resolve in the Action

6
00:00:15,089 --> 00:00:16,464
phase, whatever the result.

7
00:00:16,684 --> 00:00:20,054
Cards discarded for Time or to convert successes don't count.

8
00:00:20,054 --> 00:00:24,474
Resolving Close Call does. Cards played in other phases, like Reactions or Close

9
00:00:24,474 --> 00:00:26,241
Call in the Killer phase, don't.

10
00:00:26,461 --> 00:00:29,031
Track it with the Noise marker on the Time track.

11
00:00:29,031 --> 00:00:33,437
Some effects lower it, never below zero, and it resets to zero at the end of Upkeep.

12
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:38,093
Items make noise when you use them in the Action phase, by category.

13
00:00:38,093 --> 00:00:40,795
Silent things like a map or first aid: no noise.

14
00:00:41,015 --> 00:00:44,538
Things heard in the same space, like melee attacks or pole vaulting:

15
00:00:44,538 --> 00:00:45,004
plus one.

16
00:00:45,224 --> 00:00:48,603
Things heard in other spaces, like gunshots, a whistle or a vehicle:

17
00:00:48,603 --> 00:00:49,149
plus three.

18
00:00:49,369 --> 00:00:53,633
When you get an Item, tuck a Noise card under it showing its value as a reminder.

19
00:00:53,633 --> 00:00:57,844
Katia's Six-Shooter gets plus three, her Pickaxe plus one, and her First Aid Kit

20
00:00:57,844 --> 00:00:58,265
nothing.

21
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:03,537
The Eyeless targets normally, except on Terror cards with a Final Girl Noise icon.

22
00:01:03,757 --> 00:01:05,761
Then it targets you only if both are true:

23
00:01:05,761 --> 00:01:09,387
your Noise is at least the number on the icon, and it can reach you with its

24
00:01:09,387 --> 00:01:09,816
movement.

25
00:01:10,036 --> 00:01:13,870
If either isn't true, resolve the line after Otherwise, which can still end up

26
00:01:13,870 --> 00:01:14,559
targeting you.

27
00:01:15,367 --> 00:01:19,036
Katia resolved four Action cards and no Items, so her Noise is four.

28
00:01:19,256 --> 00:01:23,440
In the Killer phase the Eyeless first moves one space towards the closest target

29
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:27,363
from the Finale card's action, ending with a Victim, two spaces from Katia.

30
00:01:27,583 --> 00:01:30,142
Then she reveals On the Hunt. Horror goes up one.

31
00:01:30,142 --> 00:01:34,320
Its Noise icon is four, Katia's Noise is four, and its movement of three reaches

32
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,625
her. So it targets Katia.

33
00:01:35,845 --> 00:01:39,684
With three Noise, or if she'd been four or more spaces away, it would have attacked

34
00:01:39,684 --> 00:01:41,349
the Victim in its own space instead.

35
00:01:42,167 --> 00:01:45,559
Hard Skin: the Eyeless ignores the first damage it takes each turn.

36
00:01:45,779 --> 00:01:49,638
Reactive Swipe makes you lose one health whenever you leave its space, and Quick

37
00:01:49,638 --> 00:01:52,243
Counter hurts you whenever you attack it, hit or miss.

38
00:01:52,463 --> 00:01:56,894
The Epic Dark Power, High Alert, triggers at the beginning of every Killer phase.

39
00:01:56,894 --> 00:02:01,436
The card shows a red Horror-style icon there, so expect Horror to rise every Killer

40
00:02:01,436 --> 00:02:01,764
phase.

41
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:06,751
If We're Careful, We Might Just Make It! places the Eyeless on your space, but you

42
00:02:06,751 --> 00:02:09,434
may reduce Noise by one for every two Time you spend.

43
00:02:09,434 --> 00:02:11,914
Then it targets you if your Noise is two or more;

44
00:02:11,914 --> 00:02:14,547
otherwise it targets the closest, moves and attacks.

45
00:02:14,767 --> 00:02:17,857
Unlimited Endurance restores the damage you've dealt it.

46
00:02:17,857 --> 00:02:22,383
The Fear Senses Minor Dark Power resets Noise to one instead of zero, and Blinding

47
00:02:22,383 --> 00:02:24,921
Speed turns panicking Victims into casualties.

48
00:02:25,733 --> 00:02:27,440
Every Finale attacks twice.

49
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:31,031
It Can Hear Everything puts it on you once your Noise reaches four.

50
00:02:31,031 --> 00:02:33,697
It Knows My Moves strips your Reaction cards quickly.

51
00:02:33,917 --> 00:02:38,030
No More Running places it in your space and attacks twice, but you may use Movement

52
00:02:38,030 --> 00:02:40,211
effects to move Victims instead of yourself.

53
00:02:41,033 --> 00:02:45,159
A few tips. Count your cards: staying under the Terror card's Noise threshold keeps

54
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:45,705
it off you.

55
00:02:45,925 --> 00:02:50,357
Hard Skin ignores the first hit each turn, so plan two hits in a turn rather than

56
00:02:50,357 --> 00:02:50,576
one.

57
00:02:50,796 --> 00:02:54,943
Wear it down before the Finale, and hold Reaction cards for its double attacks.

58
00:02:54,943 --> 00:02:55,468
Good luck.

